@startuml task_fanout
!pragma layout smetana
title 标式化投影任务: fanout
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

participant "投影机 outbox" as PROJECTOR
database "类型任务" as TASKS
database "题目捕捉" as CLAIM
participant "工人机" as WORKER
database "MESSAGE + PLACEMENT" as SOURCE
database "成员 / 政策" as POLICY
database "USER_MESSAGE_BINDING\n+ USER_MESSAGE_STATE" as RECIPIENT_ROWS
database "投影的后续任务" as FOLLOWUPS
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENTS
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "客户端" as Client

PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable fanout(outbox_event_uuid, scope=topic)\nunique derivation; 没有 coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : 显而易见的工作
WORKER -> CLAIM : 独占的 (project_id, topic_uuid)
CLAIM --> WORKER : 拥有
WORKER -> SOURCE : 阅读位置 + 规范消息
note right of SOURCE
  主题内排序:
  MESSAGE.created_at DESC
  14:20 -> 14:19 -> 14:15
end note
loop immutable batches: user_uuid ASC; default 1000, max 5000
  WORKER -> POLICY : keyset recipients; active + expected generation
  group 一个短暂的 DB transaction
    WORKER -> RECIPIENT_ROWS : bulk conditional upsert binding + state
    WORKER -> FOLLOWUPS : immutable downstream outbox events + tasks 1:1
    WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready rows + checkpoint/next batch
  end
end
alt membership inactive / generation mismatch
  note over WORKER,RECIPIENT_ROWS
    Stale task 完成 no-op 并且永远不会恢复访问..
  end note
end
alt 和自己聊天
  note over WORKER,RECIPIENT_ROWS
    绑定和作者状态已经存在.
    没有创建接收器的额外行.
  end note
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : 释放
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : 稳定的记录
DISPATCHER -> Client : 发送 / 重复 / 播放

note over SOURCE,RECIPIENT_ROWS
  公开的 UUID = MESSAGE_PLACEMENT.uuid =
  UUIDv5(namespace=TOPIC.uuid, name=MESSAGE.uuid).
  UUID 个人使用 binding 留下来 hidden.
  Task: lease/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper,
  idempotent effect guard 根据 outbox_event_uuid.
  Retry 只有重复 batch; OFFSET 其他 unbounded transaction 禁止使用.
  在之后 batch scheduler 给了 bounded fairness 旧的工作.
end note

@enduml
